        "direction": "DESC"
      }
    ],
    "skip": 9,
    "limit": 11
  }
]
```

*Self-correction on logic*: 10th to 20th means we skip the first 9 and take up to the 20th (which is a count of 11 elements: 10, 11, ..., 20).

